Domain Entity InterventionPrescription
    documentation "This entity represents a formal prescription of an instructional approach focusing on the specific techniques and materials used to teach a given subject. This can be prescribed by academic research, an interventions vendor, or another entity."
    inline common EducationContentSource
        documentation "Resources related to or used in this intervention prescription, including any documentation around the intervention prescription itself. Since an intervention prescription is intended to be a published intervention, an intervention prescription should have at least one such resource."
        is required
    descriptor InterventionClass
        documentation "The way in which an intervention is used: curriculum, supplement, or practice."
        is required
    descriptor Diagnosis
        documentation "Targeted purpose of the intervention prescription."
        is optional collection
    descriptor PopulationServed
        documentation "A subset of students that are the focus of the intervention prescription."
        is optional collection
    descriptor Sex
        documentation "Sexes for the intervention prescription. If omitted, considered generally applicable."
        is optional collection
        role name Appropriate
    descriptor GradeLevel
        documentation "Grade levels for the prescribed intervention. If omitted, considered generally applicable."
        is optional collection
        role name Appropriate
    descriptor DeliveryMethod
        documentation "The way in which an intervention was implemented: individual, small group, whole class, or whole school."
        is required
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "Relates the education organization which is sponsoring the intervention prescription."
        is part of identity
    shared string IdentificationCode
        documentation "A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to an intervention prescription."
        is part of identity
        role name InterventionPrescription
    shared integer Dosage
        documentation "The minimum duration of time in minutes that is recommended for the intervention."
        is optional
        role name Min
    shared integer Dosage
        documentation "The maximum duration of time in minutes that is recommended for the intervention."
        is optional
        role name Max
    shared string URI named Namespace
        documentation "Namespace for the intervention."
        is optional
